/-!
# A156144

Number of partitions of n into parts having in decimal representation the same digital root as n has.

The 93 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A156144

